sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Consumer Application
    participant ai4rag as ai4rag Library
    participant S3Client as S3 Client<br/>(boto3)
    participant S3 as AWS S3<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant Docling as Docling Extractor<br/>(multiprocess pool, 8 workers)
    participant Splitter as LangChain<br/>Text Splitter
    participant OGX as OGX Client<br/>(ogx-client)
    participant Chroma as Chroma<br/>Vector Store

    App->>ai4rag: Initialize RAG pipeline
    ai4rag->>S3Client: Configure S3 connection<br/>(credentials via params or env vars)

    Note over S3Client,S3: Phase 1: Document Download<br/>(ThreadPoolExecutor, max 8 threads)

    ai4rag->>S3Client: Download documents (threaded)
    S3Client->>S3: ListObjects / GetObject<br/>HTTPS/TLS, AWS IAM Auth
    S3-->>S3Client: Document artifacts<br/>(PDF, DOCX, PPTX, HTML, MD, TXT)

    Note over S3Client: Path-traversal validation<br/>on S3 keys before download

    alt SSL Error on download
        S3Client->>S3: Retry with verify=False<br/>⚠️ Security consideration
        S3-->>S3Client: Document artifacts
    end

    S3Client-->>ai4rag: Downloaded documents (sorted largest-first)

    Note over ai4rag,Docling: Phase 2: Text Extraction<br/>(multiprocess spawn context, max 8 workers)

    ai4rag->>Docling: Extract text (parallel workers)
    Docling-->>ai4rag: Extracted text content

    Note over ai4rag: Error tolerance:<br/>configurable fraction of total docs

    ai4rag->>Splitter: Chunk extracted text
    Splitter-->>ai4rag: Text chunks<br/>(deterministic SHA-256 chunk IDs)

    Note over ai4rag,OGX: Phase 3: Vector Storage & Embedding

    ai4rag->>OGX: Store chunks + generate embeddings
    OGX-->>ai4rag: Embedding vectors

    ai4rag->>Chroma: Store chunks (alternative backend)
    Chroma-->>ai4rag: Stored confirmation

    Note over ai4rag: Phase 4: Optimization<br/>(scikit-learn + pyGAM)

    ai4rag->>ai4rag: Optimize RAG template<br/>(scikit-learn, pyGAM)

    ai4rag-->>App: Optimized RAG pipeline ready
